      "expected": "Two drop-in alternative 8-pin ATtiny footprints sharing the same nets should assign the same net to the same pin (both ATtiny45 and ATtiny13 have PB3 = pin 2, PB4 = pin 3), so the same firmware/board behaviour applies regardless of which MCU is populated.",
